<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Alex Morgan — Creative Technologist & UI Engineer Portfolio</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Professional portfolio of Alex Morgan, a Principal UI Architect and Creative Technologist specializing in building elegant, high-performance digital products.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="Alex Morgan, UI Architect, Creative Technologist, Web Engineer, Frontend Portfolio">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://example.com/">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root { --bg: #0c0e12; --card: #14161d; --text: #9fa4b7; --bright: #ffffff; --accent: #e0b35e; --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; padding: 0 2rem; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
        
        .skip-link { position: absolute; top: -40px; left: 0; background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); padding: 8px; z-index: 200; transition: top 0.2s; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
        .skip-link:focus { top: 0; }

        .wrapper { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
        
        header { position: sticky; top: 0; background: rgba(12, 14, 18, 0.8); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 1.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); z-index: 100; }
        .logo { color: var(--bright); font-size: 1.2rem; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; list-style: none; }
        .nav-links a { color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 0.25rem 0; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; }
        .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a[aria-current="page"] { color: var(--bright); border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }

        h1, h2, h3 { color: var(--bright); font-weight: 400; }
        h1 { font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1.3; }
        h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
        h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        
        .view { padding-top: 5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        .view:last-of-type { padding-bottom: 6rem; }

        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
        .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: block; }
        .card:hover, .card:focus-visible { border-color: var(--accent); outline: none; }
        .card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .card p { font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; }

        .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; padding: 1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .time { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--accent); min-width: 100px; font-weight: 500; }
        .desc { font-size: 0.9rem; max-width: 380px; line-height: 1.5; }

        .form-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
        label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--bright); }
        input, textarea { width: 100%; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0.8rem; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--bright); font-family: inherit; font-size: 0.95rem; }
        input:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible { outline: 1px solid var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
        button { background: var(--bright); color: var(--bg); border: none; padding: 0.9rem; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 500; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; width: 100%; transition: 0.2s; }
        button:hover, button:focus-visible { background: var(--accent); outline: none; }

        footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem 0; font-size: 0.8rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin-top: 4rem; }
        
        @media (max-width: 550px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .row { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>

    <div class="wrapper">
        <header>
            <a href="#" class="logo" aria-label="Alex Morgan Home">A. MORGAN</a>
            <nav aria-label="Main Portfolio Navigation">
                <ul class="nav-links">
                    <li><a href="#" aria-current="page">Overview</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#works">Works</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#chronology">Chronology</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </header>

        <main id="main-content">
            <section id="overview" class="view" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
                <h1 id="hero-heading">Alex Morgan is a <span>creative technologist</span> engineering highly accessible and functional web systems.</h1>
            </section>

            <section id="works" class="view" aria-labelledby="works-heading">
                <h2 id="works-heading">Selected Works</h2>
                <div class="grid">
                    <a href="#" class="card" aria-label="View Project details for Quantum Asset Matrix">
                        <h3>Quantum Asset Matrix</h3>
                        <p>Real-time telemetry framework tracking heavy ledger distributions securely across distributed networks.</p>
                    </a>
                    <a href="#" class="card" aria-label="View Project details for Aether Apparel">
                        <h3>Aether Apparel</h3>
                        <p>Headless boutique retail infrastructure optimizing performant edge network environments globally.</p>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="chronology" class="view" aria-labelledby="chrono-heading">
                <h2 id="chrono-heading">Chronology</h2>
                <div>
                    <article class="row" aria-label="Job positioning at Nexus Systems Group">
                        <span class="time"><time datetime="2024">2024</time> — Present</span>
                        <div>
                            <h3>Principal UI Architect</h3>
                            <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--accent);">Nexus Systems Group</p>
                        </div>
                        <p class="desc">Defines secure global UI frameworks, engineering rendering engines to completely eliminate performance gaps.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="row" aria-label="Job positioning at Aura Interfaces Corp">
                        <span class="time"><time datetime="2022">2022</time> — <time datetime="2024">2024</time></span>
                        <div>
                            <h3>Senior UI Specialist</h3>
                            <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--accent);">Aura Interfaces Corp</p>
                        </div>
                        <p class="desc">Engineered fully custom graphical layouts to visualize data telemetry streams natively in web frames.</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="contact" class="view" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
                <h2 id="contact-heading">Contact</h2>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">Have a project proposal or technical problem to solve? Send a secure parameter brief.</p>
                
                <form action="#" method="POST" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); this.querySelector('button').innerText='Message Transmitted';">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="form-name">Identity / Your Name</label>
                        <input type="text" id="form-name" autocomplete="name" required aria-required="true">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="form-email">Email Address</label>
                        <input type="email" id="form-email" autocomplete="email" required aria-required="true">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="form-msg">Message Summary</label>
                        <textarea id="form-msg" rows="4" required aria-required="true"></textarea>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit">Send Briefing Note</button>
                </form>
            </section>
        </main>

        <footer>
            <p>&copy; 2026 Alex Morgan. Built adhering strictly to WCAG AA Accessibility and Semantic standards.</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
